  "description": "Dark Northwest is a paranormal horror audio drama that brings documented encounters from the Pacific Northwest to life. Featuring original scripted stories, a full voice cast, and a chilling original score, each season is centered on a different local phenomenon and unfolds over a multi-episode arc. In-between seasons, we release bonus standalone episodes for our anthology mini-series, Tales of the Dark Northwest. Follow us on Patreon, TikTok, Instagram, Facebook, YouTube, Bluesky, and Threads @DarkNWPodcast. Visit us on the web at darknw.com. Dark Northwest is an Imagine NW production.",
